<title>FRANCE: Eiffage 1996 net attrib loss 944 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Eiffage 1996 net attrib loss 944 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable loss			944  vs    profit 206</p>
<p>    Operating					 12  vs	     876</p>
<p>    Goodwill writedown			   316  vs	     312</p>
<p>    Cashflow					  17  vs	   1,118</p>
<p>    Turnover				    33,760  vs	  32,607</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction company Eiffage gave its results in a statement. It said it aimed in 1997 to return to profit after writedown of goodwill on acquistions and before capital gains on asset sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5542</p>
